OL,3,GNEWSA#15m spent cleaning illegal waste
OL,4,Asupersite in ancient woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe clearance of a notorious illegal
OL,7,Fwaste "supersite" in Kent has been
OL,8,Fcompleted after 15 months at a cost of
OL,9,F#15m to the taxpayer.
OL,11,FThe dump at Hoads Wood, near Ashford,
OL,12,Fwhich is on a Site of Special
OL,13,FScientific Interest (SSSI) known for
OL,14,Frare plants and wildlife, was targeted
OL,15,Fby criminals who dumped nearly 40,000
OL,16,Ftonnes of waste over six months in
OL,17,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
