OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1791523601
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA#15m spent cleaning illegal waste
OL,4,Asupersite in ancient woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was the first supersite in England
OL,7,Fto have central government money spent
OL,8,Fon its clear-up, with work at two other
OL,9,Fsites bringing the total taxpayer's
OL,10,Fbill to #26m.
OL,12,FThe government said the completion of
OL,13,Fworks on Friday showed "just how
OL,14,Fserious" it was about tackling waste
OL,15,Fcrime and restoring affected
OL,16,Fcountryside.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
